LAME, libmpg123, TagLib# and CUETools FLAKE are licensed under the GNU
Lesser General Public License 2.1. They are separate libraries that
Fidena loads at run time; you may replace them with modified versions,
and their source code is available as THIRD-PARTY-NOTICES.txt describes.

